# Ollama Modelfile for a model fine-tuned per docs/OSINT_MODEL_FINE_TUNING.md.
# Copy next to the quantised GGUF, adjust the FROM path, then:
#   ollama create hse-analyze -f Modelfile.example
FROM ./hse-analyze-q4_k_m.gguf

# Lower than Ollama's default: this task wants consistent severity
# calibration and shape adherence, not creative variety.
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
